[url=https://github.com/circleainn/BG3ModManager-Redux][b]GitHub & Full Documentation[/b][/url] • [url=https://discord.gg/rJJF89vqFZ][b]Discord[/b][/url] • [url=https://github.com/circleainn/BG3ModManager-Redux/issues][b]Report an Issue[/b][/url]
